Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Polls|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Polls Question With Expiration Date
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|pollsQuestionTitle||
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Polls|
	And Polls add Poll CP With Expiration Date
		|expirationDate|01/02/3000|
		|pollsQuestion||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceA||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceB||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceC||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceD||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceE||
		|pollsQuestionTitle||
	And these variables
		|key_pollsQuestionTitle|${pollsQuestionTitle}|
	And Click at locator 'Polls#POLLS_TABLE_ACTION'
	And AssertClick the value 'Edit' at locator 'MenuItem#EDIT'
	And AssertNotChecked the value 'Never Expire' at locator 'Checkbox#NEVER_EXPIRE'
	Then AssertTextEquals the value '01/02/3000' at locator 'TextInput#EXPIRATION_DATE'
Scenario: Add Polls Question With Special Characters
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|pollsQuestionChoiceA||
	When these variables
		|pollsQuestionChoiceB||
	And these variables
		|pollsQuestionChoiceC||
	And these variables
		|pollsQuestionChoiceD||
	And these variables
		|pollsQuestionChoiceE||
	And these variables
		|pollsQuestionChoiceList|${pollsQuestionChoiceA},${pollsQuestionChoiceB},${pollsQuestionChoiceC},${pollsQuestionChoiceD},${pollsQuestionChoiceE}|
	And these variables
		|pollsQuestionTitle||
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Polls|
	And Polls add Poll CP
		|pollsQuestion||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceA||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceB||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceC||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceD||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceE||
		|pollsQuestionTitle||
	And these variables
		|key_pollsQuestionTitle|${pollsQuestionTitle}|
	And AssertTextEquals the value '${pollsQuestionTitle}' at locator 'Polls#POLLS_TABLE_TITLE'
	And Navigator open URL
	And Page add
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Polls Display|
	And Polls select Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionTitle||
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Polls view Poll PG
		|pollsQuestion||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceList|${pollsQuestionChoiceList}|
	And Polls vote Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionChoice||
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	Then Polls view Voted Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionChoice||
		|pollsQuestionTotalVotes|1|
		|pollsQuestionVoteCount|1|
		|pollsQuestionVotePercent|100%|
Scenario: Add Poll With Empty Choices And View Error Message
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Polls|
	And Polls add Poll CP
		|pollsQuestion|Test Poll Question|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceA||
		|pollsQuestionChoiceB||
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Test Poll Title|
	And Polls view Empty Choice Error Message
	And Polls add Poll Choice
		|choiceField|a|
		|pollsQuestionChoice|Choice A|
	And Polls add Poll Choice
		|choiceField|b|
		|pollsQuestionChoice|Choice B|
	And Button click Save
	Then Alert view Success Message
Scenario: Add Via Poll Display
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Polls|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Form Page|
		|portletName|Polls Display|
	And Polls add Poll PG
		|pollsQuestion|Test Poll Display|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceA|Yes|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceB|No|
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Polls Name|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Polls select Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Polls Name|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Polls view Poll PG
		|pollsQuestion|Test Poll Display|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceList|Yes,No|
	And Polls vote Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionChoice|Yes|
	Then Polls view Voted Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionChoice|Yes|
		|pollsQuestionTotalVotes|1|
		|pollsQuestionVoteCount|1|
		|pollsQuestionVotePercent|100%|
Scenario: View Chart
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Polls|
	And Polls add Poll CP
		|pollsQuestion|What is your favorite color?|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceA|Blue|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceB|Green|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceC|Red|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceD|Yellow|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceE|Other|
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Color|
	And these variables
		|key_pollsQuestionTitle|Color|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Color' at locator 'Polls#POLLS_TABLE_TITLE'
	And Navigator open URL
	And Page add
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Polls Display|
	And Polls select Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Color|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Polls view Poll PG
		|pollsQuestion|What is your favorite color?|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceList|Blue,Green,Red,Yellow,Other|
	And Polls vote Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionChoice|Red|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Polls|
	Then Polls view Poll Chart Area
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Color|
Scenario: Vote Polls Question With Guest Permissions
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Polls|
	And Polls add Poll CP
		|permissions|true|
		|permissionsViewRole|Anyone (Guest Role)|
		|pollsQuestion|What is your favorite Liferay portlet?|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceA|Blogs|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceB|Wiki|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceC|Message Boards|
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Favorite Liferay Portlet|
	And these variables
		|key_pollsQuestionTitle|Favorite Liferay Portlet|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Favorite Liferay Portlet' at locator 'Polls#POLLS_TABLE_TITLE'
	And Navigator open URL
	And Page add
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Polls Display|
	And Polls select Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Favorite Liferay Portlet|
	And User logout PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Polls view Poll As Guest PG
		|pollsQuestion|What is your favorite Liferay portlet?|
		|pollsQuestionChoiceList|Blogs,Wiki,Message Boards|
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Favorite Liferay Portlet|
	And AssertClick the value 'Please sign in to vote.' at locator 'Message#INFO_LINK'
	And Type the value 'test@liferay.com' at locator 'TextInput#EMAIL_ADDRESS'
	And Type the value 'test' at locator 'TextInput#PASSWORD'
	And Click the value 'Sign In' at locator 'Button#SIGN_IN'
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Polls|
	And PermissionsInline goto Poll Permissions CP
		|pollsQuestionTitle|Favorite Liferay Portlet|
	And Role define Permission PG
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_ADD_VOTE_CHECKBOX|
		|roleTitle|Guest|
	And SelectFrame the value 'relative=top'
	And User logout PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Polls vote Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionChoice|Blogs|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Polls Page|
	And Polls view Voted Poll PG
		|pollsQuestionChoice|Blogs|
		|pollsQuestionTotalVotes|1|
		|pollsQuestionVoteCount|1|
		|pollsQuestionVotePercent|100%|
	Then User login PG